Where Android's own labels are kept on a phone: for each label Datapavan quotes, the package, resource type and name
to read it from, by maker and Android version, with the source of each row. Names only, which are facts of each
system app's interface, not its text. Collected by the Datapavan project and dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in ADR 0054.
